  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Navigating the Path to Smile Restoration: Unveiling the Secrets of Implants of Teeth\n\n\nJuly 26, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA, have emerged as a popular and effective solution in restorative dentistry. Unlike ordinary dentures and bridges, dental implants are permanent fixtures in the mouth that replace missing teeth. They consist of a titanium post surgically inserted into the jawbone, providing a stable base for a custom-made artificial tooth.\n\n\n## The Anatomy of a Tooth Implant\n\n\nA dental implant emulates the structure of a natural tooth, including the root and the crown. The root part is a titanium post implanted into the jawbone, providing stability and stimulating bone growth to prevent bone loss.\n\nAbove the gumline, an abutment connects the post to the artificial tooth or crown, carefully crafted to match the color and shape of natural teeth. They also help maintain the integrity of the jawbone and surrounding teeth.\n\n\n## The Procedure of Dental Implants: Step-by-Step\n\n\nThe implantation procedure usually involves several stages that last several months. The first step involves a comprehensive dental examination to determine eligibility for an implant. Once approved, the titanium post is surgically inserted into the jawbone.\n\nAfter the surgery, a healing period allows the implant to integrate with the bone. Finally, the artificial tooth is placed over the implant post, completing the smile restoration process.\n\n\n## Benefits of Dental Implants in McLean, VA\n\n\nDental implants offer an array of benefits. They restore the functionality of the teeth, improve oral health, and boost aesthetic appeal by providing a natural-looking restoration. Moreover, with appropriate care, dental implants can last a lifetime, making them a cost-effective solution in the long run.\n\n\n## Common Misconceptions about Implants of Teeth\n\n\nDespite the numerous benefits, some misconceptions about dental implants persist. It is often perceived that the procedure is painful; however, with modern anesthesia, patients experience minimal discomfort. Also, dental implants’ longevity and success rate are frequently underestimated, but studies show this treatment to be highly successful and durable.\n\nOur practice has years of experience delivering dental implants with precision and success. Are you ready to restore your smile with dental implants at our skilled and trusted dental practice?\n\nPlease don’t wait to get the smile of your dreams. Contact Dr. Nahlah and our exceptional team at our Prosthodontist office in McLean, VA, to schedule today!\n\nPrevPreviousUnraveling the Complexities: Complications in Implant Dentistry\n\nNextRevolutionize Your Smile with Dental Implants in McLean, VANext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
